{"id":"9bb4f14b9e117268","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-dependency-graph.md","title":"df-dependency-graph","display":"df-dependency-graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-dependency-graph","aliases":["56-df-dependency-graph"],"display":"df-dependency-graph","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[56-df-dependency-chain]]"],"source_section":"6.5.44–6.5.47","source_pages":"251–252","source_ocr_blocks":[272,273],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-dependency-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-dependency-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependency-graph"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" href=\"?note=6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" title=\"56-df-dependency-chain\">56-df-dependency-chain</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.5.44–6.5.47"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"251–252"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>272</span><span>273</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" href=\"?note=6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" title=\"56-df-dependency-chain\">56-df-dependency-chain</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,R,\\Sigma^\\#,\\to_R^\\#\">\\(\\Sigma,V,R,\\Sigma^\\#,\\to_R^\\#\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(P=\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>；图的节点是依赖对本身，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 独立选取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DGEdges}(\\Sigma,V,R):=\\{((s,t),(u,v))\\in P^2\\mid\n\\exists\\sigma,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma^\\#,V)\\;\nt\\sigma\\;(\\to_R^\\#)^*\\;u\\theta\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DG}(\\Sigma,V,R):=(P,\\mathrm{DGEdges}(\\Sigma,V,R)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DGEdges}(\\Sigma,V,R):=\\{((s,t),(u,v))\\in P^2\\mid\n\\exists\\sigma,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma^\\#,V)\\;\nt\\sigma\\;(\\to_R^\\#)^*\\;u\\theta\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DG}(\\Sigma,V,R):=(P,\\mathrm{DGEdges}(\\Sigma,V,R)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 pp.251–252 给出的精确 dependency graph。旧稿用单个替换连接两规则，没有实现原书中独立替换 a、τ。任何无限链产生无限图路径，但图中有环不保证存在满足所有跨边替换一致性的无限链。例如书中 Example 6.5.46 的终止 TRS 仍有带自环的依赖对节点。精确边的一般可判定性不成立；Definition 6.5.47 的可计算近似图只保证为超图，不能把“近似图有环”判为非终止。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.5.44–6.5.47，印刷页 251–252。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-dependency-chain","status":"resolved","id":"6a7c74fcead3e2ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-dependency-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-dependency-chain","status":"resolved","id":"6a7c74fcead3e2ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-dependency-chain]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,R,\\Sigma^\\#,\\to_R^\\#$。记 $P=\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)$；图的节点是依赖对本身，$\\sigma$ 与 $\\theta$ 独立选取。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,R,\\Sigma^\\#,\\to_R^\\#","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\mathrm{DP}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DGEdges}(\\Sigma,V,R):=\\{((s,t),(u,v))\\in P^2\\mid\n\\exists\\sigma,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma^\\#,V)\\;\nt\\sigma\\;(\\to_R^\\#)^*\\;u\\theta\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DG}(\\Sigma,V,R):=(P,\\mathrm{DGEdges}(\\Sigma,V,R)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1615,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-236","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-dependency-graph.md]]"}],"outgoing":["6a7c74fcead3e2ed"]}